 created_at/created_by, updated_at/updated_by, deleted_at/deleted_by ada di SEMUA tabel dengan FK ke users.id &amp;#8212; sengaja tidak digambar agar relasi bisnis terbaca. deleted_by disarankan ON DELETE SET NULL." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="786" width="760" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>